        <p>pITTS'S GENERAL FURNISHING BUSINESS 1 has assumed such vast dimensions that increased eecommodai ion has become absolutely indispensable. PITTS'S have, therefore, purchased THE PANTHEON. GAY THORN, together with Albion Mills adj,ining, erected at a cost of many thousands of pounds, equipped same with every modern convenience. and opened them as an up-to- date Furnisldng Establishment, to run conjointly with PITTS'S, London-road Business,</p>
